-SDK stage provenance
-====================
-
-Imported from the bootrom.tar.gz supplied with this migration.
-start.S preserves the .text bytes, defined symbols and text relocations
-of start.o. stages.S preserves the exact move_data.img and boot2.img bytes.
-These imported vendor portions retain their original licensing; this
-migration does not assign a new license to the vendor bytes.
