-stock bootloader, preserve the board-specific block from the original image::
-
-    tools/en7512_image.py --image u-boot-en7512.bin \
-        --stock tcboot-stock.bin --output u-boot-en7512-board.bin
-
-The block contains data such as the MAC address, model and board GPIO values.
-Do not flash the unmerged combined image over a device whose board data has not
-been backed up.
+An earlier stage initializes DRAM and loads U-Boot at ``0x81000000``. Depending
+on the board and recovery path that stage may be a vendor BootROM/DRAMC flow or
+an external replacement flash/chainloader project. U-Boot consumes the DRAM
+size and clock handoff left in ``REG_SAVE_INFO`` and does not rebuild or embed
+the early boot stages.
 
 Build
 -----
